    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set in a cul-de-sac on an elevated site, this well-maintained house has a large private rear lawn, parking for a number of cars to the front plus enough space at the side to allow the next owners to make a drive to the rear if desired. Internal accommodation comprises of sitting room with fire, large kitchen/dining room and WC on the ground floor with three bedrooms (one of which is en-suite) plus a bathroom on the first floor. This house has been tested for MICA/defective block issues and has a clear result (report available). Viewing of this conveniently located home is guaranteed not to disappoint. BER Pending."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Three bedroom home.<br><br>\nHallway - 4.4m x 2.1m <br>PVC front door with two side windows. \nCarpeted stairs leading to first floor. \nCupboard under stairs. \nFloor tiled. \n<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 3.8m x 3.3m <br>Open fire. \nBay window overlooking front lawn. \nFloor carpeted. <br><br><br>\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.5m x 5m (Max. Measurement) <br>Galley style kitchen with high and low level units. \nStainless steel sink.\nIntegrated fridge/freezer - included. \nElectric oven and hob - included.\nIntegrated dishwasher - included. \nWashing machine fitted - included. \nFloor tiled. \nWalls tiled between units. \nDouble patio doors opening onto paved area. \nWindow overlooking rear lawn. <br><br><br>\nWC - 2.2m x 1.4m <br>WC and WHB. \nAccess off hallway.\nGable window.\nFloor tiled. <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 3.3m x 3.2m <br>Floor carpeted.\nFront facing window. \n\nEn-Suite:\n2.4m x 1.2m\nWC, WHB and shower. \nFloor tiled. \nWalls part tiled. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.6m x 2.7m <br>Floor carpeted. \nWindow overlooking rear lawn.\nRecessed to accommodate built-in wardrobe. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 2.7m x 2.7m <br>Floor carpeted.\nWindow overlooking rear lawn.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.7m <br>WC, WHB and bath. \nShower over bath.\nFloor tiled. \nWalls part tiled. <br><br>"
      },
